.Dd August 2026
.Dt XPT.TREE 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xpt.tree
.Nd package file listing format
.Sh DESCRIPTION

.Nm
is a plain text file listing the files installed by an
.Xr xpt 8
package, one path per line.

.Pp
.Nm
is read by
.Xr xpt 8
and its paths recorded into the package database, associating each file with the owning package.
blank files are ignored
.Pp
example:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
usr/bin/foo
usr/share/man/man1/foo.1.gz
etc/foo.conf
.Ed
.Pp
.Nm
is generated by
.Xr ebs 1
as part of building an
.Xr xpt 8
package alongside
.Xr xpt.manifest 5

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mkfhs 1 ,
.Xr ebs 5 ,
.Xr ecw 8 ,
.Xr libxpt 3 ,
.Xr ebs 1 ,
.Xr xpt.manifest 5 ,
.Xr xpt.index 5 ,
.Xr xpt 8
